/api.github.com/repos/QuantumGrasshopper/grasshopper2d/contents/CITATION.cff?ref=5d0ea3bf993d95804dc3bdb927d5a5a6fe7759b0", "patch": "@@ -12,6 +12,8 @@ abstract: >-\n   success probability for a fixed jump distance, with an optional\n   nearest-neighbor interaction.\n version: \"1.0.0\"\n+date-released: \"2026-08-28\"\n+doi: \"10.5281/zenodo.22149974\"\n license: GPL-3.0-or-later\n repository-code: \"https://github.com/QuantumGrasshopper/grasshopper2d\"\n keywords:"}, {"sha": "28aef6dccafc4d109665b2b6e98f0255a6c22b0e", "filename": "README.md", "status": "modified", "additions": 2, "deletions": 0, "changes": 2, "blob_url": "https://github.com/QuantumGrasshopper/grasshopper2d/blob/5d0ea3bf993d95804dc3bdb927d5a5a6fe7759b0/README.md", "raw_url": "https://github.com/QuantumGrasshopper/grasshopper2d/raw/5d0ea3bf993d95804dc3bdb927d5a5a6fe7759b0/README.md", "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/QuantumGrasshopper/grasshopper2d/contents/README.md?ref=5d0ea3bf993d95804dc3bdb927d5a5a6fe7759b0", "patch": "@@ -1,5 +1,7 @@\n # Grasshopper2D\n \n+[![DOI](https://zenodo.org/badge/DOI/10.5281/zenodo.22149974.svg)](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22149974)\n+\n Grasshopper2D is a C++ implementation of simulated annealing for the planar Euclidean grasshopper problem on a square grid. The lawn has unit area and is represented by `N` occupied grid cells. The code searches for configurations that maximize the discretized grasshopper success probability for a fixed jump distance `d`, with an optional nearest-neighbor interaction.\n \n ## Citation"}]}